    1 │ <!-- should generate diagnostics -->
    2 │ 
  > 3 │ ## Section A
      │ ^^^^^^^^^^^^
    4 │ 
    5 │ # An h1, ignored under level=2
  
  i A single top-level heading acts as the document's title. Additional ones break document outlines, tables of contents, and the structure produced when converting to HTML.
  
  i Demote this heading to a lower level, or move its section into its own document.
  
